[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3000.63, "timestamp": "00:50:00", "text": "私は留守にしていました。 君のために離れていたんだ。 でも、どうして"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3003.75, "timestamp": "00:50:03", "text": "あなたはそんなに女性らしい見た目なの？ えっと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3007.829, "timestamp": "00:50:07", "text": "つまり、アンドロゲン・ガイのキャラクターなんです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3009.589, "timestamp": "00:50:09", "text": "ゲームについて話す場合も、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3011.91, "timestamp": "00:50:11", "text": "モデルについて話す場合も、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3013.589, "timestamp": "00:50:13", "text": "性別は関係ありません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3016.79, "timestamp": "00:50:16", "text": "星座なので性別はありません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3018.47, "timestamp": "00:50:18", "text": "だから、女性キャラクターだとは言えません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3020.63, "timestamp": "00:50:20", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3023.43, "timestamp": "00:50:23", "text": "そう、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3026.95, "timestamp": "00:50:26", "text": "だってそれは、あなたみたいなもの、なんて言うんだっけ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3028.87, "timestamp": "00:50:28", "text": "？ あなたはアニメを見ますよね？ まるで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3031.51, "timestamp": "00:50:31", "text": "レムルテンペストみたいだ。 まるでレムル"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3033.109, "timestamp": "00:50:33", "text": "テンペストみたいだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3037.349, "timestamp": "00:50:37", "text": "彼は卑劣な奴だ。 レムルはスライムです。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3038.454, "timestamp": "00:50:38", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hi joq"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3040.71, "timestamp": "00:50:40", "text": "リムウルはスライムなので、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3043.829, "timestamp": "00:50:43", "text": "性別を付けることはできません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3047.19, "timestamp": "00:50:47", "text": "私は星座、つまり天体なので、ショーはまさにそんな感じなんです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3049.67, "timestamp": "00:50:49", "text": "。"}]